WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.025
Personnel fall into two groups:

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:05.357
end users — for example customers and accountants —

00:00:05.357 --> 00:00:06.925
and I C T professionals.

00:00:06.925 --> 00:00:10.322
Professionals include systems analysts, programmers,

00:00:10.322 --> 00:00:14.568
network administrators, database administrators, and technicians.
